{
  "about": "The shapes ELI v3 sends a body in the version-2 world message for the Memory Archive's and ELI's own room's books, the Evidence Wall's beliefs, sheets, scoreboard and charts (eli/world/shown.py, eli/world/books.py, eli/world/spatial_feed.py). tests/test_world_spatial_feed.py checks every real payload against it; world_feed_v2_example.json is one real payload, for a body's own tests. A key starting with ? may be left out. Types: str, int, number, bool, null, object, a name of a shape here, array<type>, and a|b for either.",
  "message": {"objects": "array<object>", "thoughts": "array<thought>", "evidence": "evidence"},
  "capabilities": ["books", "evidence"],
